{"type":"after","callId":"jgqi@1492","endTime":311596.773,"result":{"value":"All projects\nWEB EXPERIENCE / 06\nPrintlific.\n\nA photo-printing storefront presenting personalized wall art, product formats, and image-led inspiration.\n\nPROJECT TYPE\nWeb & web apps\nFOCUS\nPhotography & commerce\nORIGINAL PROJECT ARTWORK\nOverview\nKey features\nDesign\nScreenshots\nDevice views\n01\nPROJECT OVERVIEW\nFrom a photograph to a printed piece.\n\nPrintlific’s web artwork introduces printed photographs on materials including canvas, plexi, and wood. Product imagery and galleries explain the offering visually, with clear calls to create a print. Its desktop layouts connect creative inspiration with the product-selection side of a printing service.\n\n02\nKEY FEATURES\nA closer look at\nthe experience.\n\nThe flows and interface elements visible in Printlific's original project material.\n\n01\nPrint formats\n\nThe presentation identifies multiple materials for printed photographs.\n\n02\nCreate-a-print entry\n\nA prominent action provides an entry point to the personalization flow.\n\n03\nProduct showcase\n\nPhotographic examples show prints in their intended physical context.\n\n04\nStorefront sections\n\nProduct and service information sit within a consistent shopping layout.\n\n03\nDESIGN DIRECTION\nIts own identity.\nIn every detail.\nPhotography & commerce\n\nRich blue, white space, and a compact header frame the artwork. Large image compositions demonstrate the physical product, while modular product sections make different print formats easy to compare visually.\n\nDesign observations from the supplied project artwork.\n04\nUI SCREENSHOTS & ARTWORK\nInside Printlific.\n\nExplore the original interface screens. Select any image for a closer look.\n\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n01\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n02\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n03\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n04\nDESIGN COMPOSITION\n05\n05\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN PRESENTATION\nA view across\nthe original devices.\n\nPrintlific's original portfolio composition presents the website on laptop and tablet devices. The artwork below preserves those supplied layouts together, with their original proportions.\n\nThese are source mockups of the project, rather than a new rendering of its live website.\n\nPrintlific / Original device composition\nSOURCE MATERIAL\n\nProject descriptions are based on the published artwork and available overview. Interface observations do not imply verified implementation details or measured business results.\n\nOriginal project page\nNEXT WEB PROJECT\nNerdrabbit\nKEEP EXPLORING\nMore perspectives.\nView all work\nTALENT & RECRUITMENT\nNerdrabbit\nCHILDCARE & DISCOVERY\nParachute\nEDUCATION INTERFACE\nGlocal Expert\nHAVE A PROJECT IN MIND?\nLet's make your\nnext idea real.\nBook a free consultation"}}
